{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>《女神配對計劃2》Oscar與Roxanne經歷「蘋果之夜」後展開突破性單獨約會。今日（22日）播出的第12集 …</p><p></p>\n<p>《女神配對計劃2》Oscar與Roxanne經歷「蘋果之夜」後展開突破性單獨約會。今日（22日）播出的第12集驚見意外插曲，Roxanne（何沛珈）終於剖白對「Emo男」的真正顧忌！</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17953415871416855_13460670006b02bd138e89b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"何沛珈 emo Oscar曾在自我介紹形容自己是「陽光、搞笑、Emo」，坦言日頭嘻嘻哈哈、夜晚容易內耗，令到何沛珈卻步！（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17953415871416855_13460670006b02bd138e89b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Oscar曾在自我介紹形容自己是「陽光、搞笑、Emo」，坦言日頭嘻嘻哈哈、夜晚容易內耗，令到何沛珈卻步！（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>《女神配對計劃2》約會揭開女方「心結」首度披露恐懼真相</h2>\n<p>藉著這次驚心動魄的單對單約會，兩人深入觸及情感盲區，Roxanne決定直面積累已久的心理障礙。她首度向男方披露害怕「Emo男」背後隱藏著不為人知的洋蔥真相，坦承過去曾因情緒問題一度變得相當不理智，這段脆弱經歷一直成為揮之不去的心魔。Oscar聽畢女方充滿傷痛的往事後大感心痛，兩人隨即深入探討如何跨越這道情感屏障。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/31_5390024566b02c26beff90-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"何沛珈 emo （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/31_5390024566b02c26beff90-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/32_8455414796b02c26dda6cb-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"何沛珈 emo （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/32_8455414796b02c26dda6cb-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>自揭「Emo」屬性成致命傷？女神Roxanne單刀直入</h2>\n<p>身高176cm、體重62kg的Oscar，在節目初期女神們自我介紹時形容自己是「陽光、搞笑、Emo」，當中「Emo」一詞瞬間引發女神及花生團的高度關注與猶豫。Roxanne更忍不住單刀直入，向Oscar深入了解「Emo」的定義。雖然Oscar無論外表及氣質均相當優雅，但這個標籤似乎已令女神們卻步。當中Kanis看來對Oscar頗有興趣，更不斷追問問題，嚇得其家姐要急急致電「煞停」妹妹，並警告：<b><strong>「佢講過佢係會內耗嘅人，你都係好內耗嘅人，所以我就有啲擔心。」</strong></b></p>\n<h2>Roxanne事後剖白內心感受大讚Oscar舉動極溫暖</h2>\n<p>歷劫重生的Roxanne事後對Oscar大為改觀，向節目組坦白內心真實感受。她直言在自己陷入無助與恐懼的瞬間，男方的貼心舉動猶如強心針，並親口評價「我覺得佢關注點喺我身上，而唔係淨係自己enjoy，我覺得warm嘅。」男方在整個約會過程中不但用心聆聽，更不時探問女方喜好，細心溫柔的表現成功融化女方防線，令兩人感情極速升溫。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/34_21169138116aab6d6d4b1da.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"何沛珈 emo 女神配對計劃2 oscar （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/34_21169138116aab6d6d4b1da.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>女神配對計劃2 oscar （圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>網民期待食花生 對兩人後續發展抱觀望態度</h2>\n<p>節目預告曝光後引發網絡熱烈討論，不少網民對這對歡喜冤家的神級反轉感到驚喜。討論區上有留言表示「估唔到平時怕怕醜醜，關鍵時刻咁有膊頭」、「男方今次真係成功得分」。也有觀眾對女方隱藏的創傷感到同情，紛紛留言「每個人背後都有段古，希望佢可以放低過去」、「期待今晚第12集揭曉到底經歷過咩事」。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179534158860146853_11616640816b02bd1501251.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"何沛珈 emo （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179534158860146853_11616640816b02bd1501251.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/emo/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">emo</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e4%bd%95%e6%b2%9b%e7%8f%88/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">何沛珈</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a5%b3%e7%a5%9e%e9%85%8d%e5%b0%8d%e8%a8%88%e5%8a%832/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">女神配對計劃2</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%83%85%e5%82%b7/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情傷</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：TVB資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3547850\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 22 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T12:24:16.444184+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1397,"images":5,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T10:16:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T14:17:25.950380+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T12:17:37.932028+00:00","content_hash":"56d53a79a2b9d82f656830e5d61f4d66c5d894c9eba38ed19ac57c0761127505","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}